{title: Taare}
{artist: Aatish}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Ginte main taa [Bm]re saare de sa [D]are,        Ait [A]ho vadh ki das int [G]ezar kara
Tere bi [Bm]na na chahan kis [D]se nu,        Ai [A]tho vadh ki das tenu py [G]ar kara
Chann [Bm]bhul sakda ch [D]adna,        Taare [A]luk sakde ne ba [F#m]dalan pichhe
[Bm]Par main bin bul [D]le chadh da han,        [A]Kothe utte [F#m]tere pichhe
[A]Aitho wadh ke ki das aitb [G]aar kara [Bm]n,        Bas [Bm]do hi cheezan ya [A]ad ne
Mainu [F#m]tu te tera [Bm]naa,        Mainu [Bm]lagda si [A]mud aawenga
Bol [F#m]da si banere [Bm]kann,        Yaa [Bm]dan teriyan
[D]nu bhul kiven ja [A]waan ma [F#m]in,        Moti [Bm]chun chun mala
[D]vich pa [A]waan ma [F#m]in,        [A]Ehho kamm roz vaar va [G]ar kar [Bm]aan
Main ud [Bm]eek ch zindagi [A]kat deni,        Tu aa [F#m]ve ya na [Bm]aave
Tere ji [Bm]sm di khawahish [A]nayi mainu,        Teri ro [F#m]oh mainu mil [Bm]jaave
Teri [Bm]akhan vich,        ak [D]han pa ke [A]vekha ma [F#m]in
Tenu [Bm]bukal ch le,        [D]ke nigh [A]sekan ma [F#m]in
Nir [A]maan pher koi na sawa [G]al ka [Bm]raa,        Ginte main [Bm]taare...
